Package: h5cohort
Title: Cross-Language HDF5 Cohort and Parameter Interchange (R side)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Daniel", "Hintz", email = "dhintz@guardanthealth.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read and write cohorts (as a named list of data frames) and
    parameters to and from an HDF5 file following the shared h5cohort layout
    (see FORMAT.md). Also provides a directory-tree print method for HDF5
    files. The Python sibling package reads and writes the same layout, so
    files written by one language are read natively by the other.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    hdf5r
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
